            "review_title": "Review at 7 Toi Pancake",
            "review_text": "Ivan L\nSweden83 contributions\n0\nDelicious Mekong Pancakes and Great Service in Authentic Casual Vietnamese Setting\nJan 2025 • Family\nWe enjoyed a lovely meal at this restaurant in Can Tho. The setting had an authentic Vietnamese feel, with a spacious hall filled with steel tables and sturdy chairs, creating a casual and typical atmosphere.\n\nThe staff were friendly and efficient, ensuring drinks and a generous plate of mixed leafy greens were served right away. Although one item was initially missed from our order, it was quickly brought out after we mentioned it.\n\nThe food was very fresh and flavorful. The Banh Xeo was pleasantly yellow and crispy, and the Banh Khot were topped with mung beans. Portion sizes were satisfying, and the presentation was simple yet appealing.\n\nThe restaurant was clean, and prices were reasonable for the quality of food and service. It’s a great place to experience Mekong-style pancakes and authentic Vietnamese cuisine. Definitely worth a visit!\nRead more\nWritten January 1, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
