            "review_title": "Review at 7 Toi Pancake",
            "review_text": "Smithers\nHanoi, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nWow! Best meal in Can Tho by far\nDec 2022\nI always try to eat banh xeo whenever I am in Southern Vietnam. It's not easy to find in Hanoi where I live. Unfortunately, they often can be very oily. This banh xeo was absolute perfection. It wasn't oily at all. The pancake was crispy and the filling with coconut, shrimp and duck was amazing. It was accompanied by a big basket of fresh greens and a delicious dipping sauce. It's worth the 10-15 minute Grab ride from the city center to grab lunch or dinner here. I will need to return to Can Tho just to eat here again!\nRead more\nService\nFood\nWritten December 23, 2022",
